          "comment": "# Comfy Flux.1 Dev- Text to Image\n\nGenerate high-quality images with Flux Dev full version. Requires larger VRAM and multiple model files, but provides the best prompt following capability and image quality. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/flux_dev_full_text_to_image.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
